{
  "6": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e323c7a3cb0c7a2226905d86854449b8f8b7de568e4c9b6976f05bb012833e73",
      "text": "Nn... nnngh... gggrrrh...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "9": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a178487a2fab53a98216cd72957a75c432cb8f4019d0dee3c650474cbfbfe400",
      "text": "Almost there! A little to the right!\nI said RIGHT! No, too far!\nGet it together, Prince of Flight!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "13": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3b7ce98ea8de694a970b4f762a174b2c9afb35b0a79bb08ca77d85adcf6dd7a7",
      "text": "I TOLD you I'm bad at fine\ncontrol stuff, like, all the time!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "17": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2f65dd0c1d471813615f8f3118a2e49c57321d0e23bc320ce74aadbe1f2ce53c",
      "text": "...This is a good town.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "20": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d8c8bb29c04f32e35d92ad025610676f80541fcd9a91ddfa0081857b6a46b91e",
      "text": "It's brimming with energy. And yet\nit's peaceful and calm. How strange.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "23": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:57844e2436eedcaa7ac22a43edf0a1db12fcbebec5093167079c8813d84b130f",
      "text": "And despite the scars still showing,\nyou can work together like this...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "27": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a02688221ccb3cdd89f70d4df482cce35254c38d9345703c8258e66be750b59a",
      "text": "Huh... is it? I mean, I\nthink everybody's working\nsuper hard, but...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "31": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:95f210c020e40ff0905074197bf73de987ea258b7b26abf1468a1100a67f5a58",
      "text": "It's simply normal for you, isn't it?\nI'm a little envious.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "35": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6c81f2d9cb1cad541296b8c435863ad8359c3baf777e74515a52a56f809de797",
      "text": "Haaah... okaaay...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "40": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:223a77f6d5eb1106254c9f96da1ab84e521c101b59a146b0c2299591c3463410",
      "text": "She's complimenting you.\nRight, Lanmei?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "45": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6d43b1fd4050d303b354d1a7bdecd04e9b22a9d2cb044cb36383aeba3921ddf0",
      "text": "Yes. You've received from this town\nsomething I've longed for all along.\nThat's a wonderful thing.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "50": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:98267b445eed994290b1fa07ddee1beea0f1e96a2f56e5e1bbce5e38add1b078",
      "text": "Huh? Hehe? Don't get it, but\nthanks!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "56": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fb87e1948597d3379873105c539312c731bf626f42fc8427c9b3748de3e3f37d",
      "text": "I'm fine, I'm fine, really...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "58": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:90b2fc7f76291eb0889bb3d9654792bd519ecfdebeb09cc4d7ebd332c1cab2d5",
      "text": "Of course you're not fine! You\ncollapsed from overwork! What you\nneed right now is rest!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "61": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:80c840729938755b41ddb63ddd271d53670b832e5b6bfd6438b2761dd41ba9d4",
      "text": "...You're a volunteer in the Youth\nCorps' reconstruction effort, right?\nMayor Takamori mentioned it.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "63": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c0452f55475bf64a5bb3dc70bb23fcc0d76071e906d1630f743a962f4f36a195",
      "text": "But why push yourself so hard?\nYou're only a volunteer, aren't you?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "66": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3f2627de0ac83a895ba9ad435c77b4ec6e163353b5c7a29b5ad30315e7a2e0fe",
      "text": "B-because guys like me can't just\ngo around saying it's hard, right!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "68": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:56eeb1bba814611161691dc87f2e25783db17705abc7c3e0773ac3da454137d8",
      "text": "My buddies, the old guy, everyone's\nworking hard and serious. The whole\ntown is in it together...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "71": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:dded10d4342449cbb4d8740340a8c4a40869024b1e5700988649d9453b79391f",
      "text": "...I don't think we need that.\nThat kind of thing...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "75": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4539ff779787797220e629709284ab48cb3973daa8fa3b8025b32d416598145d",
      "text": "...I see. It's certainly\nnot all good. And I agree.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "78": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8bb29732a5f2f69695807181535adcf4b1f2054078dbac420f9c8c05f2932e5b",
      "text": "Hey, you okay!?\nI heard you collapsed!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "80": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:000d03cb0ed224334c02d249906eae6672d92e5b607eaf63bcf36add8c8865da",
      "text": "O-old guy...\nI—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "82": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:18c5e13c2399cb4cba63d6ea9384c20b325c902d697565a7cb64e2d208ac4973",
      "text": "No, it's all right. It's okay.\nDon't rush. We'll wait for you,\nI promise!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "84": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:81777bf84af21279e4737384633ff531c679f0771543568719a183bba33aa04e",
      "text": "Rest up and get your strength back,\nand let's do our best again together!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "88": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4fcf3da14c7d3b3d0acb6da85800b50503b41f0ea9434803496ff1639c28071c",
      "text": "Excuse me, may I have a moment?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "92": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:cda077243c2d9f22bfc39bcff705e6a806c78a7ec0c61e5ecada44a4d6aea120",
      "text": "I'm the one who took that boy in.\nI have a proposal for you.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "96": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7a90b5894e5fc271fd8d2797cb266ec6acf522a917e21b24b88c0a9cfcb38b7a",
      "text": "...Would you give that boy to me?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "101": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:dd89b7a0c087d2463c413c3394cbc419219f0bd184144b90572e2c5eb5af5e6c",
      "text": "W-what are you saying...!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "105": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8e6813ed7cd8b110c589aed96c358d461891df7fed9751707514ca9be3f378e8",
      "text": "Your power. Psychic power, you said.\nIt's a wonderful gift. I could\nmake sure you're valued highly.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "108": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e3d5da0f735b13fb91d4632cb222a653e0f93e710fa4594f50e2618a16ba6260",
      "text": "H-hey! What exactly are you—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "111": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:029fc5942298549e4581b5308af0216bbef5a085c739f07f387801fbf85f262a",
      "text": "You needn't use your power for the\nthings that bind you.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "114": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c335be495dc71ca8d78a2a6204a151029aa4be69e1cb5d0a81b2d2d8c397136c",
      "text": "With me, a villain, I can forgive\nyour mistakes.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "117": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:39ff0a9c10792e211ad0a32ee36bc2af71f04cc8ecbaa1e901e8f3e632e88e40",
      "text": "Ngh—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "119": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2d45916374b831e7a978400286f3666d3cb55e41b03062b851b6bc7b2d6fe784",
      "text": "Stop it! He's doing his best right\nnow! He's trying to walk the\nrighteous path—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "122": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b25d7a2ab8d9d95e4b09af0fae6f283227f1c43d9607f340909eeb329437dee0",
      "text": "Even though that righteousness, the\nidea that he mustn't say it's hard,\nis eating him alive?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "126": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0aeca666dbd715c0c1232df3ab6321589c9362def95d268d61416b9fea60f0d2",
      "text": "Is that... true...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "128": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bafd5a7445a64afc2b24d4c65dff4d3cda5858b25cd4512ff05a10fa5f31c538",
      "text": "No... old guy, it's my fault...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "131": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:493564cac4929c17140b8bb5c241f32a4579042ceb15bada38348a64f97f0e91",
      "text": "I'm sorry!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "133": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:21b7ac9c5dabdacb5ee698732817cd7b2f1c812a978e722bacf16fcc37c3f79f",
      "text": "I know you're anxious. So I thought\nthat if you want to work hard, you\nneed somewhere you can.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "135": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c0cbf27d1ffc46563cfbc26432c7766302750c4b084d7f12ca982f923f587195",
      "text": "But if it's not right, say so!\nIf you want to complain, you can\ncomplain all you like...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "137": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c0c688fc1941672cdee23073fbd62c7a807d1833696e184ccc43415f271f4f6d",
      "text": "No, I was the one who made it so\nyou couldn't. ...I'm truly sorry!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "139": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e26bba4d80620d314bc4c102cc519436788058d843913cb2950b953f8409c3d0",
      "text": "...Old guy.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "142": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ff47635059001f03c0415af95f1ca93f087c962e0fb282f864b03dc5e43897c4",
      "text": "...Heh, how disappointing.\nLooks like the villain wasn't needed.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "148": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:880aebb8ac47975ce52ff113e431097e1adaa63251090d2d92bc65b5573d0a50",
      "text": "...Honestly. You're extreme.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "152": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3d37e78a0a805fe5614e7296839bfce236cd7658fa4af3e636b1706d8b989bd7",
      "text": "It's the only way I've ever lived.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "156": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a9750101326f7c036aad4f4c772dc9165de684ae05d656d91a073dffd38f6850",
      "text": "Huh, what? What's going on...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "161": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:77aa7360ceaf3ac04f072ae2b3d14b9ceb92f6dfb9ad5779c2d5e33755764882",
      "text": "Call it shock therapy. It was an act\nto draw out the poison.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "165": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f4a7dd7857c8f475b77fb3ff04c5146d6706149f248e91ffeac64a1ff0efa9d7",
      "text": "It was no act.\nI was recruiting him in earnest.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "168": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:21ade2f7b1502cbc43a01578cf163c89580aa714b3f0ef5235c0a73e7c1527db",
      "text": "If the world is one where the weak\nand those who strayed can only punish\nthemselves, then trample it down.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "171": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f37b2b99113044a0c09eb6d82ee73cc2663090e9420615f4917f301e3d3ba06b",
      "text": "That's the only way I can teach.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "177": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:cf177e3446e7797d20a97ffead847ffbc8299f0c02f6aa9fd2c3d19a8a663785",
      "text": "And yet you want to rebuild society.\nWhat a difficult personality.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "181": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bfbe08f1633e61ce8320d0da909ecebe4cf500f1df70eb3684c261eabec51aea",
      "text": "...But, like, I kind of get it.\nHonestly, I wobbled a bit.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "184": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:193fae116a12fe6effffaa4c46f407ecf852459587b41b29adacccfbfa44ac04",
      "text": "We mess up all the time,\nyou know? We don't want\nto, but we can't help it.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "187": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1b492dc2c642b8b27a244cba5fa3b7a8d593951fe898f7e1b207764cfe4f6e96",
      "text": "So I think, whatever, it happens, but\nhe didn't look ready to listen.\nThat was super cool, though.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "191": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3c234c4085964c00caf22f83765954ed51ea52064dc8520a12573b38e8b1fa81",
      "text": "I'm honored by the praise.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "194": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c8f1b0eb07e26485fb19f147d5ef8b8774fda25e418f6a676304934a5210e855",
      "text": "But that you can say that,\ntoo, is something this\ntown built up over time.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "198": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a31818055906df973a37ac9f0a936eb6f6caca6979514f28c1d65250869564c8",
      "text": "You can't suddenly start calling the\nextraordinary ordinary, after all.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "202": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2f4e5af2fb3bd595f5189f7c60577688b1bdf746781346f9aed93cc93d75421a",
      "text": "Would you show me around the town\na bit more? Schools and educational\nfacilities especially.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "206": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:81aa0d85a7ec408c0519a892e5e22ae3f3894b894a260a659470e4b0cb7beee3",
      "text": "Uh, okay...\nBut I can't say anything\ncomplicated, y'know?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "210": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d80b21750ded4ace463423f3abfb1e2b5babf18fa2946087fd0d550a29c10550",
      "text": "That's fine.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "213": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:762376d92e03159fafb4c5299400ac8aab40aae88c0d472954d873939ca53467",
      "text": "What you feel is surely what\nmatters.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
